    can be precisely described as:

    .. math::

        out(N_i, C_j, h, w)  = \frac{1}{kH * kW} \sum_{m=0}^{kH-1} \sum_{n=0}^{kW-1}
                               input(N_i, C_j, stride[0] \times h + m, stride[1] \times w + n)

